{"date":"1935-01-05","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/63/38/132358_LIZyD.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/63/38/132358_LIZyD.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/63/38/132358_LIZyD.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/63/38/132358_LIZyD.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/63/38/132358_LIZyD.jpg"},"summary":"      热闹的森林里正在举行跑步比赛，参赛双方实力悬殊。一边是有蓝色飞毛腿之称的巨兔，另一边老态龙钟、步履蹒跚的老乌龟。巨兔傲慢无礼，丝毫不把这个无精打采的老家伙放在眼里，甚至对其肆无忌惮地嘲弄。老乌龟性格善良，对巨兔的恶意玩笑似乎全无知觉。随着一声枪响，巨兔如旋风一般冲出起跑线，而他的对手则被巨大的声响吓得缩入壳中。对手的软弱更令巨兔的傲慢肆意膨胀，他或者躺在路边睡觉，或者和赛道边上的小母兔们调情，或者炫耀其敏捷的身手。老乌龟则一如既往，坚定地向终点跑去…… \r\n　　本片荣获1935年奥斯卡金像奖最佳动画短片奖。","name":"The Tortoise and the Hare","name_cn":"乌龟与兔子","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":40,"total_count":101271},{"name":"欧美","count":21,"total_count":85977},{"name":"1935","count":15,"total_count":222},{"name":"迪士尼","count":13,"total_count":19439},{"name":"奥斯卡","count":13,"total_count":1845},{"name":"Disney","count":13,"total_count":7556},{"name":"美国","count":10,"total_count":26923},{"name":"龟兔赛跑","count":6,"total_count":6},{"name":"欢乐","count":5,"total_count":6452},{"name":"寓言","count":5,"total_count":789},{"name":"1930s","count":4,"total_count":127},{"name":"剧场版","count":3,"total_count":716362},{"name":"音乐节拍剧","count":2,"total_count":2},{"name":"动物","count":1,"total_count":6159},{"name":"原创","count":1,"total_count":611474},{"name":"Oscars","count":1,"total_count":31},{"name":"Wilfred·Jackson","count":1,"total_count":10},{"name":"子供向","count":1,"total_count":12480},{"name":"WilfredJackson","count":1,"total_count":8},{"name":"Silly-Symphony","count":1,"total_count":22},{"name":"30s","count":1,"total_count":58},{"name":"搞笑","count":1,"total_count":629432},{"name":"1935年1月","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"cartoon","count":1,"total_count":113},{"name":"1930-1939","count":1,"total_count":98},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":35298},{"name":"WaltDisneyPictures","count":1,"total_count":14},{"name":"其它","cou